      "side": 1,
      "message": "This kind of break should not be unconditionally allowed. If we keep this in \"allowed_breaks\" file and eventually merge it to `android15-6.6`, we may miss real ABI break. Please remove `allowed_breaks` and use Lint+2 bypass instead, if you are intended to break ABI. Or rework this change to not break ABI, if you aim for this change to be merged to `android15-6.6` eventually.",
